Package: tidyversindonesia
Type: Package
Title: Indonesian Version of 'tidyverse' Functions
Version: 0.1.3
Date: 2026-07-24
Authors@R:
    person("Yandi", "Andiyana",
           email = "tidyversindonesia@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides Indonesian counterparts to core 'tidyverse'
    functions to help learners understand data science with R more
    intuitively. The package follows the core workflow introduced in
    'R for Data Science' (2nd edition), covering data import,
    tidying, transformation, and visualization. It serves as an
    educational bridge to the 'tidyverse' ecosystem, helping users
    gradually transition to the standard 'tidyverse' functions.
